#   KEEP: read_orders (abandonedCheckouts already works), read_all_orders,
#         read_draft_orders, read_products
#   NEVER: write_* / theme / storefront (unauthenticated_*) / Place Order
# Staff manage_abandoned_checkouts only if GraphQL starts denying abandons.

