# Phase 2 official APIs (GA4 + Search Console + Google Ads). Same names as Vercel.
# Dana mirrors from 1Password — never chat-paste. Leave blank on machines
# that should not run ga4-sync / gsc-sync / google-ads-sync (jobs stay unscheduled).
